  "name": "Chicken Burrito Bowl",
  "subtitle": "A simple bowl of grilled chicken, rice, beans, corn, and fresh toppings.",
  "description": "Build a satisfying burrito-style bowl with seasoned grilled chicken, warm beans and corn, rice, lettuce, and creamy salsa toppings.",
